# User Stories

# US-001 - Create Goal

## Title
Create a new goal

## Description
As a user,
I want to create a new goal,
so that I can track my personal progress.

## Business Value
Users need a central place to manage long-term and short-term objectives.

## Priority
High

## Acceptance Criteria

- User can enter a goal title.
- User can choose a category.
- User can select the goal type.
- User can set a deadline (optional).
- User can choose between:
  - Numeric goal
  - Checklist goal
- Goal is saved successfully.
- Goal appears on the Dashboard.

## UI

Create Goal dialog

## Dependencies

None

## Future Improvements

- Goal templates
- AI-generated milestones
- Goal duplication
